#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:5 0ff859e8fde941eca103b8a9f877fc25
msgid "Arming the motors"
msgstr "解锁推进器"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:7 b59ab715ab624458a8c9749aca51c66d
msgid ""
"Arming the vehicle allows the thrusters to start spinning.  Before "
"arming, make sure all people, objects, and any body parts (e.g., hands) "
"are clear of the thruster propellers."
msgstr "解锁载具后，推进器将开始转动。解锁前，请确保所有人员、物体及身体部位（如手部）远离推进器螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:9 adca6dae0cdc4075b5e55def32a5eaa2
msgid "In order to arm:"
msgstr "解锁步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:11 a2089c43d6e14428969a7ede5796a3be
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Pre-Arm safety checks must be passing (See :ref:`common-prearm-safety-"
"checks`). It is recommended that :ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK<ARMING_SKIPCHK>` be"
" kept at 0 (no checks skipped) to prevent arming with system issues "
"present. You must have also provided a method to Disarm the vehicle, "
"either by GCS button assignments (``BTNx_FUNCTION``), or "
":ref:`AUX_FUNCTION <common-auxiliary-functions>`."
msgstr ""
"必须通过解锁前安全检查（参见 :ref:`common-prearm-safety-checks`）。建议启用 "
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` "
"对所有可用系统及传感器进行检查，以防止在存在系统问题时解锁。您还必须提供一种锁定载具的方法，可通过 GCS "
"按钮分配（``BTNx_FUNCTION``）或 :ref:`AUX_FUNCTION <common-auxiliary-functions>`"
" 实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:12 89efe961439c443a85569fed34f5fc43
msgid ""
"The throttle must be at idle value if :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 5"
" is set (\"Arming check throttle for 0 input\"). Normally, this would be "
"a center stick if bi-directional vertical thrusters are used."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 第 5 "
"位已设置（「解锁时检查油门为零输入」），则油门必须处于怠速值。如果使用双向垂直推进器，通常对应摇杆居中位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:13 150f2198ca4d41c39a82206a75104644
msgid ""
"An arming pilot control must be activated, eg. GCS joystick button with "
"\"Arm\" function assigned, GCS MAVLink ARM command given, or an "
":ref:`Auxiliary function <common-auxiliary-functions>` such as ARM/DISARM"
" (\"153\") is used by either GCS command or RC channel switch (if "
"enabled)."
msgstr ""
"必须激活一个解锁飞手控制，例如：分配了「Arm」功能的 GCS 摇杆按钮、发送 GCS MAVLink ARM 指令，或通过 GCS 指令或 RC"
" 通道开关（如已启用）使用 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 如 "
"ARM/DISARM（「153」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:16 70e0021359de4154b519959ca46416bb
msgid "Disarming the motors"
msgstr "锁定推进器"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:18 79fad828834c457388cc55d14b7df4b1
msgid ""
"Disarming the motors will prevent the motors from spinning. The motors "
"are disarmed when:"
msgstr "锁定推进器后，推进器将停止转动。以下情况下推进器会被锁定："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:20 9c73f0b411f34b6b956dc7b1542f14a4
msgid "GCS joystick button with a \"Disarm\" function assigned is pressed."
msgstr "按下分配了「Disarm」功能的 GCS 摇杆按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:21 fa2cbc1a66ee4ce9ad2a1dcdf746ad94
msgid "A MAVLink DISARM command is received"
msgstr "收到 MAVLink DISARM 指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:22 9f4146ee9d0847d69829b692e42e29c2
msgid ""
"An :ref:`Auxiliary function <common-auxiliary-functions>` such as "
"ARM/DISARM (\"153\") is used by either GCS command or RC channel switch "
"(if enabled)."
msgstr ""
"通过 GCS 指令或 RC 通道开关（如已启用）使用 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 如 "
"ARM/DISARM（「153」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:25 23719f3895674760a15c5fd174aece21
msgid ""
"the AUX Function \"31\" (Motor Emergency Stop) or \"165\" (Arm/Motor "
"Emergency Stop) can also be used to prevent motor operations, but do not "
"\"Disarm\" which would reset the home location and require the pre-arming"
" checks to be passed before re-arming."
msgstr ""
"AUX "
"功能「31」（推进器紧急停止）或「165」（解锁/推进器紧急停止）也可用于阻止推进器运行，但不会执行「锁定」操作——锁定会重置归航位置，并要求重新通过解锁前检查才能再次解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:28 d5a0e30b1ba04ef5b227f9b653c7e834
msgid "GCS Status Messages"
msgstr "GCS 状态消息"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:29 3f9b6973092d40b195e2c50646f3a466
msgid ""
"Unless the :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` bit 2 is set, text "
"messages will be sent to the GCS to indicate when arming or disarming has"
" occurred."
msgstr ""
"除非设置了 :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 的第 2 "
"位，否则在解锁或上锁时将向地面站发送文本消息以进行指示。"

